            "review_text": "Bird\nUnited States13 contributions\n1\nReally good for service and foods\nDec 2018 • Couples\nWas impressed on my very first visit here. Nice staff and good food. Price that is reasonable.\nService was impeccable and additionally the food was all the best quality. The beef was scrumptious! They'd actually help you to grill your red meat till excellence.\nWill come back here once again.\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten December 29, 2018\nKing BBQ\nDear Mr/Ms Bird, \n\nThank you for dining at King BBQ Hai Ba Trung and leave us such a great review. We are very glad to hear that you enjoyed your meal with our restaurant. We always try our best to deliver better service to customers everyday. We are looking forward to seeing you again.\nRead more\nWritten December 30, 2018\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
